{
  "_help": [
    "Route library for the Wind Ride Planner. Edit freely, then run the tests (they validate this file).",
    "WAYPOINTS ARE APPROXIMATE SUGGESTIONS. Verify every route on a map before publishing.",
    "Each route is a round trip: the first and last waypoint should be the meeting point.",
    "type: 'short' (Tuesday, ~60-120 km) or 'long' (Saturday, ~200-350 km).",
    "distance_km: real road distance of the full loop (measured with OpenStreetMap routing; check in Google Maps).",
    "waypoints: in riding order. 'exposure' describes the stretch FROM the previous waypoint TO this one:",
    "  urban | highway | open_desert | coastal | causeway  (multipliers live in config.json).",
    "Optional per waypoint: 'turnaround': true marks where 'the way out' ends and 'the way back' starts",
    "  (default: the waypoint farthest from the start). 'key': true keeps the point when Google Maps",
    "  links are thinned to the waypoint limit - use it for points that force the right road."
